                "entry_id": "283097d1-9b09-34c5-8712-0b1f6dfdaebd",
                "word": "stationmaster",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "80cad135-77b8-4bb0-a286-c8a64c9f9b90",
                        "entry_id": "283097d1-9b09-34c5-8712-0b1f6dfdaebd",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "stationmasters"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6ea11c18-4b92-3669-9fba-544baebb3b71",
                        "entry_id": "283097d1-9b09-34c5-8712-0b1f6dfdaebd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The person in charge of a railroad station, usually an employee of a particular railroad by which the station is owned, but sometimes an employee of a separate corporation, such as one owning a station used by two or more railroads."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7202d19d-df7f-4f20-8452-57a034f1b7af",
                                "sense_id": "6ea11c18-4b92-3669-9fba-544baebb3b71",
                                "text": "The glare, the flies, while they waited, and he and the stationmaster put their heads together over the time-table, trying to find this other train, which, of course, they wouldn't catch."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9c2f6b1f-f5e7-4edf-aa5a-0ed5e4fdfe7d",
                                "sense_id": "6ea11c18-4b92-3669-9fba-544baebb3b71",
                                "text": "The stationmaster was an important part of the local community. Anyon Kay, in his reminiscences of Horwich in the early 20th century, remembers a Mr Horsfield as stationmaster - \"a gentlemanly character who took his job very seriously\"."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "74732f74-d1ad-4a54-b7b1-2be4cca499d4",
                        "source_entry_id": "283097d1-9b09-34c5-8712-0b1f6dfdaebd",
                        "source_sense_id": "6ea11c18-4b92-3669-9fba-544baebb3b71",
                        "source_sense_description": "the person in charge of a railroad station",
                        "target_lang_word": "chef de gare",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "chef de gare",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fd5a5ca4-c93d-34f8-bb70-bb776fc1b3e5",
                                        "entry_id": "4b6cbbf1-86d8-36de-9ff0-76a0a6d5152f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Celui dirigeant une gare ferroviaire."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "35c835ee-64c3-4cc6-94e3-d87bef39cf27",
                                                "sense_id": "fd5a5ca4-c93d-34f8-bb70-bb776fc1b3e5",
                                                "text": "À chaque station importante se prélasse une sorte de chef de gare dans un uniforme assez semblable à celui de nos suisses d’église, portant en broderie le blason de la duché, et faisant faire place avec une canne à pommeau d’argent."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc8ec55d-322f-49fb-8c93-93875d6974d3",
                                                "sense_id": "fd5a5ca4-c93d-34f8-bb70-bb776fc1b3e5",
                                                "text": "— Dans le cas très improbable d’une guerre, ne pensez-vous pas, mon cher collègue, que les vrais généraux, ce seraient les chefs de gare ?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0eaf34ae-04bc-475c-9236-32fae927c58d",
                                                "sense_id": "fd5a5ca4-c93d-34f8-bb70-bb776fc1b3e5",
                                                "text": "Cela m’amusait beaucoup de voir les chefs de gare, coiffés d’une casquette rouge ou bleue, se tenir au garde à vous, au passage des trains. Les nôtres sont plus décontractés, nous nous permettions même de les chansonner."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f7cd1f81-1762-40c6-8245-a67e772754a0",
                        "source_entry_id": "283097d1-9b09-34c5-8712-0b1f6dfdaebd",
                        "source_sense_id": "6ea11c18-4b92-3669-9fba-544baebb3b71",
                        "source_sense_description": "the person in charge of a railroad station",
                        "target_lang_word": "Bahnhofsvorsteher",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Bahnhofsvorsteher",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "66284892-073f-347b-922a-ef50b9f779e5",
                                        "entry_id": "e3ce5499-61dc-3488-ac1b-c1b304e81573",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Beamter, der einen Bahnhof leitet"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "outdated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d286d6e2-6505-4505-991a-8bd938e008e8",
                                                "sense_id": "66284892-073f-347b-922a-ef50b9f779e5",
                                                "text": "Der Bahnhofsvorsteher überprüfte das Kassenbuch der Personenkasse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0cb4a64-0770-4256-9695-51100e79691a",
                                                "sense_id": "66284892-073f-347b-922a-ef50b9f779e5",
                                                "text": "„Es dauerte gar nicht lange, da kam Papa mit zwei Fahrrädern zurück, und er sagte, er habe die Fahrräder von dem Bahnhofsvorsteher von Bullay geliehen bekommen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "475a44fe-5adb-41ea-841b-683eb1ec0f89",
                                                "sense_id": "66284892-073f-347b-922a-ef50b9f779e5",
                                                "text": "„Der Bahnhofsvorsteher, zu dem wir am Morgen vordringen, sagt uns das mit allen Zeichen des Entsetzens.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "09dc3d40-c0a1-4197-a1d4-bfbdf37a16fc",
                                                "sense_id": "66284892-073f-347b-922a-ef50b9f779e5",
                                                "text": "„Der preußische Bahnhofsvorsteher von Gera mochte die Sachsen noch weniger als die Sachsen die Preußen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1590be9e-671a-4faf-9c39-d28168808669",
                                                "sense_id": "66284892-073f-347b-922a-ef50b9f779e5",
                                                "text": "„Man sperrte sie in einen Viehwagen, der auf dem Gleis vergessen worden war, und brachte sie mir dann einzeln ins Büro des Bahnhofsvorstehers.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
